WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.980
We will attack on the 24th...

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.230
On Christmas Eve.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:10.240
We will summon every ounce of our power to seize

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.030
the Dresden Slates, the ultimate sacrament.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.240
And with it, fulfill our goal as JUNGLE to...

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.250
Are you guys listening?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.830
Sure we are, Nagare-chan.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.750
Oh dear, I got a wrinkle here.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.130
I see, Yukari.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.260
Then I shall continue.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.890
Presently, the Slates are kept inside the Mihashira Tower.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.970
My original plan was this:

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:43.020
Now that the Gold King is no longer
around to suppress its power...

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:48.400
the Slates should be able to serve its original purpose to evolve mankind.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.860
After all, Kokujoji Daikaku was an exception.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.360
There was no way that young
and inexperienced Blue King

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.030
could possibly control the Slates’ power.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:01.040
That’s why I left it untouched in that building, and yet...

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.790
Are you guys listening?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.420
Sure we are, Nagare.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.630
Yes! I leveled up!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:09.840
I see.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.800
Congratulations, Sukuna.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.680
In any case, the Blue King has proven me wrong
by lasting longer than I had anticipated.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.140
Most impressive.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.310
To make matters worse, the Silver King has returned.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:25.060
And a new Red King was born.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:28.150
Now, they have joined forces to guard Mihashira Tower.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.150
So, we are left with only one other option.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:35.820
To bring the Slates under our direct control.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:40.330
And, none of you are listening to me, at all.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.200
Come on you two, pay attention.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.460
He may not look it, but he’s still our king.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:50.380
Stop fooling around
and show the guy some respect.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.840
Seems to me you’re the one
with the least respect, Iwa-san.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.590
Don’t get me wrong, Iwa-san.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:00.640
I’m just fixing myself up for the coming battle...

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:05.680
I want to make sure I look gorgeous
and elegant as I walk through the battlefield.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.980
My heart is filled with excitement...

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:11.730
I’m ready to draw my beloved Ayamachi anytime.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.820
Yeah, same here.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.990
I’m playing games to keep myself busy.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.700
Otherwise, I can’t stop myself from
wanting to go out and fight.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:24.990
Seriously, I totally get what
you’ve been saying, Nagare.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.660
I see...

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.330
So both of you are fully prepared.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.830
I am most impressed.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.670
Well then, after we take possession of the Slates,

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.010
we’ll have a lavish Christmas party and celebrate.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.630
Chicken, chicken!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.550
Juicy and yummy!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.010
Kotosaka, I expect you to do your share too.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.680
You see?

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:48.140
We’re all pumped up and ready to go.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.350
And you know me...

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:54.400
I’ll just be relaxing and drinking my beer.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.780
Say, Nagare-chan...

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:02.160
Isn’t it unusual for you to hold
an official meeting like this before a job?

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.080
Could it be you’re starting to feel a little insecure?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.910
After all, you are taking on three kings.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.420
As if. Right, Nagare?

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.170
Well...

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:21.050
I must admit, an alliance of the Silver,
Red and Blue Kings is formidable.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.010
However...

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.990
Greetings. Thank you all for coming.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.450
How is everyone doing today?

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.490
Not too happy, it seems.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.370
Perhaps in consideration of
my position as the Silver King,

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:19.250
you won’t blatantly oppose...

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.510
However, do I detect a little resentment at

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:26.550
my calling you out so often and taking charge?

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:30.760
May I speak freely, Silver King?

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.270
By all means, Kusanagi-san.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.310
Now we’re going on the premise

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:40.770
that the Green Clan will attack
Mihashira Tower to steal the Slates...

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.280
Are you sure about this?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.070
Yes...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.950
And if they do get the Slates,

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.280
then the world order which
the Lieutenant... I mean, the Gold King

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:57.710
and the Blue King here have worked so hard to preserve... would collapse.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.550
At the very least, the world that you
and I know would cease to exist.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.840
The reason...

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.970
Is because the Green Clan’s goal is to pass on

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.300
the power of the Slates to all mankind.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.890
I believe I can speak for the Red,

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.150
and probably for the Blue Clan over there,

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:25.320
when I say none of us question
your status as king.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:30.450
However, that and whether
you’re capable of leading this operation

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.580
is a completely different matter.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.910
I’ll be frank.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:37.330
I’m not sure if you have what it takes.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:41.000
I’ll have you know Shiro is amazing!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.290
Settle down, Neko.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:49.470
Kusanagi Izumo, I may sound biased,

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.600
but this man is more than qualified for this task.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.640
He has the brains,
the leadership skills and good judgment.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.810
Kuro...

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.190
Thanks...

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.600
And you too, Kusanagi-san.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:05.230
You chose to play the devil’s advocate for everyone, right?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:13.200
There’s a simple reason why
I’m directing this counter attack.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:18.370
I know everything there is to know
about the Green King Hisui Nagare.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.750
Hey wait a minute!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.630
How’s that possible?

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.760
I thought the Green King avoided
being seen in public!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.930
Don’t tell me you’re tied to them!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.760
To put it simply...

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:39.180
The Green King Hisui Nagare once challenged

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.730
the Gold King Kokujoji Daikaku...

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.770
all by himself.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.270
Recorded images of that incident
remain intact in its entirety.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.110
The Lieutenant passed on the data to me,

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:54.530
and I heard the details from the Lieutenant himself.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:59.040
May I comment, Silver King?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.120
Of course, Awashima-san.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:05.630
And please, just call me Shiro.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.040
I understand.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:12.300
Shiro-san, if I may be frank,
I can’t believe all this.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:17.050
Why would the Green King issue
such a reckless challenge?

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.020
Perhaps it wasn’t so reckless.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.690
I say this because although he lost in the end,

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.940
at one point, the Green King held his own

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:31.320
against the most powerful king
and the fight was nearly even.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.950
And then, there’s his excuse of
wanting to overthrow

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.160
the Gold King in the first place,
which was outright ridiculous.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.200
To quote his parting message before escape...

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.830
“I wanted to beat the final boss.”

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:46.830
What is he, a kid?!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.840
The guy is messed up.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.550
After barely running away from the Gold King,

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:55.180
the Green King dropped out of sight.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:59.850
His clan never made a move until now
because the Lieutenant was still around.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:04.640
But the Lieutenant is no longer here...

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.110
That’s why I’d like to command this counterattack.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.200
I know how to defeat Hisui Nagare.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:18.780
The Green King is unbelievably strong,
but he can be beaten.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:23.120
It’s just that it’s not possible without your help.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.080
I get what you’re saying, but...

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.130
I’ll do it.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.630
Anna?

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.380
I’ll help.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.970
You will, eh?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:38.050
Well then, I have nothing more to say.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:41.100
Silver King... I mean, Shiro-san...

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.890
The Red Clan will help.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.770
Thank you.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.390
What about the Blue Clan?

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.900
It depends on the details of your strategy.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.900
Naturally...

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.820
Then let me get to that now.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.030
Kuro?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.410
On it.

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:06.160
The fight against the Green Clan
won’t center on Hisui Nagare,

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.750
but these two...

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.250
Mishakuji Yukari and Gojo Sukuna.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.920
Remember these faces well.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:17.880
Our first priority is to keep these two at bay.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:21.050
Okay? Now, to do that...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.940
I think the strategy makes sense.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.650
Let’s do our best.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.610
Thank you, Kusanagi-san.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.190
I’m counting on you, Anna.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.690
That you can.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.860
By the way...

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.950
What’s your opinion of that personage?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:45.450
He doesn’t let on what he’s thinking.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.710
Can we count on him or not?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.370
I don’t know.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:53.130
But we can’t win otherwise.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.590
That’s how strong our opponent is.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.600
Reisi...

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.640
Besides...

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.810
Since Lieutenant passed away,

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.730
he is the one who has suppressed
the Slates... all by himself.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.900
That’s an exhausting burden to bear.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.480
I don’t blame him for being extra cautious.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.360
That thing needs a king’s strength to control it...

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.740
Otherwise, mankind will evolve without limits.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:28.750
Munakata-san has taken over
and continued the Lieutenant’s work.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:32.040
We... and I in particular...

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.750
must be grateful to him.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.180
<i>Two Green Clansmen sighted</i>
<i>at the front main entrance!</i>

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:44.220
<i>It’s Mishakuji Yukari and Gojo Sukuna!</i>

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.100
They’re breaking in!

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.190
Surveillance cameras in
all four areas have been destroyed!

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:57.780
Here they come!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.490
Men! Draw your swords!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.960
Merry Christmas!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.090
We came to get the Slates!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.300
Guess the only one worth any points here...

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.760
Is Awashima Seri, their number two!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.560
Sounds like it’s started.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:39.150
Shiro, I have utmost faith in your strategy.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.440
But are you sure about this?

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.570
Leaving the first floor just to the Blue Clan?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.910
As I explained during the strategy meeting,

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:50.160
the first task in our counter attack is to stymie

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:55.460
the Green King’s two heralds as much as possible.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:56.210
Scissors, scissors, scissors!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.880
Their goal is to weaken

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:58.040
our fighting power.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.550
Scissors,

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.970
So we’re going to do
the opposite and weaken theirs.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:06.640
I’ve told Awashima-san
to withdraw her men when it feels right.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.970
Don’t worry.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:13.230
And is it true that the Green King
can only stay active for a limited time?

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:17.020
Yes. The Green King is almost invincible.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.860
If he gets serious, I don’t know if even the Blue King,

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:23.860
the Red King and I together can defeat him.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:27.700
In fact, he’s probably capable
of taking down every person

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.990
in this building single-handedly.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:34.370
But he can’t sustain that kind
of power for very long.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.540
I see...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.040
Meow!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.170
Hey Shiro, isn’t this pretty exciting?

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.880
What on earth are you talking about?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.590
I mean Shiro is here...

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.050
And Kurosuke is here...

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:49.140
We’re all together!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:52.600
We’re all working together to do our very best!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.640
And that makes me feel so happy inside!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:02.190
Good grief...
you’re always so optimistic.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.940
Yes, she is.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:08.280
We’re all in on this, so it’ll be okay.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.950
When this is over, we’ll have
a grand Christmas celebration.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:16.870
Come on!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.620
Damn it!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.040
That bitch is starting to get on my nerves!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.290
Sukuna!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.050
Don’t go after her.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:23.880
But...

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.960
You know the drill, right?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.470
We should be heading up.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.140
Up! Up!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:35.310
Nagare-chan can only fight for a limited amount of time.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.600
Our job is to open up a path for him.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.150
You’re right. This isn’t the place
to use up our resources.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:50.110
Looks like you’ve concocted
a lavish scheme, but it’s useless.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:55.700
After all, I am the beautiful flower that blooms amongst the rich green known as JUNGLE.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.660
And you are just a nutrient that feeds us.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.250
All you do is to make us look better.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:03.750
Yeah... whatever.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:08.920
The new Red King has such
a convenient power.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:12.640
With this, we can communicate without
worrying about interference from the Greens.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:16.890
<i>Mishakuji Yukari and Gojo Sukuna</i> <i>have infiltrated.</i>

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.100
<i>Okay, everyone, let’s do this.</i>

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:28.400
Now, if only everything goes according
to Isana Yashiro’s plan.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.110
We’re not done yet!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.120
We’ll rendezvous with the team upstairs

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.280
and stop those two with a pincer attack!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.830
<i>Our cameras have picked up</i>
<i>Mishakuji and Gojo on the tenth floor!</i>

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:39.960
<i>Roger that.</i>

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:40.830
<i>Just as planned,</i>

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:44.210
<i>I’ll manually activate</i>
<i>the Mihashira Tower security measures.</i>

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.710
<i>Entrapment 10E.</i>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.090
<i>Plus 3, plus 4, F minus 4.</i>

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.260
Entrapment normal deployment confirmed.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.470
And heaven and nature sing!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.470
We have a full course of traps ready...

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.640
Needle ceilings, pitfalls, and electric shock...

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:00.100
Let’s see you dance out of these.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.690
They cleared all of them!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:08.440
Entrapment 11D minus 3, minus 4, minus 5.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:12.610
S plus 4, plus 5, Z whole nine yards.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.450
Entrapment normal deployment confirmed.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:20.040
Mishakuji Yukari and Gojo Sukuna
have been separated!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:24.210
However, they’ve suffered very minimal damage!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.250
Damn monsters...!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:30.420
We will separate those two who are
extremely powerful, and lure them.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:33.680
We, the Reds, will take on Gojo Sukuna.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:38.100
The Silver Clan will surround
Mishakuji Yukari and bring him down.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.350
It’s a strategy that’s impossible
without Fushimi’s total grasp

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:47.520
of this building’s security system
and his flawless operations set-up.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.360
Right, Yata-chan?

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.570
Kusanagi-san...

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.200
Even I know when to admit how good he is

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.910
when it comes to stuff like this.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.410
So the brat we’re in charge of...

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.870
Think it’s about time he showed up?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:01.870
Yeah...

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.080
That’s one thing I’ll thank Shiro for.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.880
That bastard’s gonna pay for what he did!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.390
Oh?

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.010
What the hell?!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.140
Why is the pansy here, Monkey?!

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:24.640
These two are ridiculously strong.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.190
I managed to lure them,
and if the targets got switched,

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.650
that’s a minor headache!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.280
<i>If you’re going to complain...</i>
<i>try doing this yourself!</i>

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:39.570
The three clans will put every resource available to pin down Mishakuji and Gojo...

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:45.040
Then the Silver, Red, and Blue Kings
will attack the Green King together.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:48.750
I suppose this is
the only option we have left.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:49.540
However...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.420
What is it, Kuro?

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.630
I’m disappointed in myself.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.300
If only I were stronger...

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:02.680
If I could at least handle
Mishakuji Yukari on my own...

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:07.100
It would make this battle easier for you.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.690
Kuro...

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.770
I’ve only heard stories,

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:18.200
but I don’t believe you
are inferior to Mishakuji Yukari.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.700
What do you mean?

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:28.040
I’m saying that you weren’t able to fully access your power as a Silver Clansman.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:33.340
The way I see it, you display
your true strength when...

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:39.720
Shiro! Something is closing in!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.680
Could it be Mishakuji Yukari?

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.600
Neko, if the parrot is with him,
can you take care of it?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.350
Uh-huh... You bet!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.980
I’ll turn him into roasted chicken
and eat it for Christmas!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.900
It’s not Mishakuji Yukari...

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.360
It’s Gojo Sukuna!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.860
Whoa! It’s the Silver King!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.910
Imagine, encountering
the final boss here, of all places!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:07.120
I was getting irritated with all the traps, but...

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.370
Lucky me!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.500
Shiro, let’s get him!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.920
Guess I’ll save Nagare the trouble
of having to deal with you!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.920
Plus I get to earn myself massive points...

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.510
Silver King!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.180
Don’t get... carried away!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:26.430
<i>I wonder how the Red Clan is doing.</i>

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.640
Yata-san! This is bad!

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.730
Like, very, very, very, very, very bad!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.350
Just shut up and run!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.370
Bang!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:54.290
Is there no end to this?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.630
It’s obvious that they’re trying to stall us.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.300
How ungraceful...

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.510
Time to go for the mid boss!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:20.940
My body feels light.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.030
Is it because Shiro nearby?

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.660
Don’t ignore me!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:25.820
Neko!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.120
I’m on it!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.500
W-What is this?!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.470
Damn it!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:43.720
That’s not fair!

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.180
Complain all you want.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.470
Uh-oh... Shiro’s got
that evil look on his face.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.600
Now then...

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.520
This is as far as you go.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:58.610
It’s the end for you as a fighting power.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.860
The end, my ass!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:07.160
Well now, they’re really putting up a fight.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:11.620
I’d say we’ve cleared... maybe 70%.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.290
Think we got here a little too early...

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.420
Nagare?

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:18.380
No, not at all.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.250
I’m going to enter the battle.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.380
Huh?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:26.430
Hey, hey, there are three kings
waiting for you up there.

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:31.220
Just wait until Yukari-chan
and Sukuna clear a path for you.

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:32.640
I won’t wait.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:38.150
So you won’t even listen to the one
who’s been like a father to you?

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.020
Affirmative.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:42.400
I will do as I please.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.910
Turning rebellious on me, eh?

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.660
Fine, go on.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.870
Thank you, Iwa-san.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.290
I appreciate that.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:22:00.540
The alliance of the Silver, Blue
and Red kings is indeed powerful...

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.300
But for me...

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.300
It’s an easy win!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:27.990
Well, go and have a blast.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.870
Not even the steel prison can
contain the green beast.

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.210
As the Green King climbs to the top,

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:08.800
the other kings stand ready to face him.

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:11.550
His wish: A game with no rules...

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:15.510
Where only the strongest will reign...

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:19.430
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:22.310
#7 “Kickdown”.

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:27.610
But our feelings are no game!
